{"kind":"table","sheet":"Aktivasi SaaS","address":"A1:C23","rows":23,"cols":3,"values":[[null,null,null],["Pilot SaaS HOTS dan Overseas",null,null],["21 Oktober 2026 | Database additive diterapkan; production SSO belum aktif",null,null],[null,null,null],["Area","Status","Bukti dan batas"],["Database","Diterapkan: 4 tabel tambahan","migration.json; migration-hierarchy.json. Existing business rows tidak diubah/dihapus."],["Program HOTS","103 / hots-web","Existing; origin www.indofoodinternational.com."],["Program Overseas","108 / hots-overseas","Baru; SSO disabled dan belum ada client registration."],["Company hierarchy","Indofood -> IndoUSA, IndoCanada, IndoVietnam","Relasi eksplisit sesuai konfirmasi pengguna."],["Kevin Excom","Root Indofood + turunan, program 103 dan 108","Grant hanya brand.read/resources.read. Tidak memberi write/admin/Cineva access."],["Yosua admin","Akun existing terverifikasi; tidak diberi grant baru","Global role tidak otomatis menjadi hak lintas program/company."],["Persistence","Session/context/login: hash, expiry, soft revoke","createPersistentTenantRuntime; transaksi + rollback; raw opaque keys tidak disimpan."],["Ticket pilot","Scoped list/detail + ownership join","Ticket existing belum dibackfill; route bisnis lama belum dimigrasi."],["Frontend","HOTS ticket list mengikuti company aktif","Scoped client; response company lama ditolak; konfigurasi API mount/CSRF per aplikasi."],["Package + HTTP","62 lulus","checks.json; source/package dan HTTP lokal, bukan production identity."],["Browser","9 lulus","browser.json; production build + API fixture, screenshot diperiksa."],["MySQL nyata","15 lulus; rollback terverifikasi","live-pilot.json; grant nyata dibaca, ticket/session uji tidak menyisakan row commit."],["TypeScript","Fitur: 0; full app: 113","types.json; seluruh aplikasi belum bersih."],["Release","15 export bundle ter-load","release.json; bundle fitur, bukan deployment penuh HOTS."],["SSH backend 105","Process root aktif berbeda dari source lokal","production-backend-redacted.json; modul/dependency OIDC tidak ditemukan pada root yang diperiksa."],["SSH frontend 104","Proxy fondasi baru belum terpasang","production-frontend-routes.json; pemeriksaan read-only, tidak ada restart/deploy."],["SSO live","Belum terverifikasi / belum diaktifkan","Registrasi DB tidak membuktikan provider production aktif. Issuer/JWKS/callback perlu rollout bertahap."],["Aktivasi berikutnya","Provider SSO, runtime, proxy, mapping ticket","Rincian: architecture/saas_pilot_activation_2026_10_21.md. Tidak mengganti production lama otomatis."]]}
